    1. Pick grid 10x10, bg color, frame color, sprite color (all distinct).
    2. Choose frame size S (3-8, square) and place it on grid with room for sprite outside.
    3. Choose sprite bbox (1x1 or 2x2) and pick a valid 4-connected pattern within it.
